                <p>Omit “$786,212,000”, substitute “$804,411,000”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 49(w)</heading>
