            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 49</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; and (x)	for the financial year starting on <date date="2023-07-01">1 July 2023</date>—$801,410,000.</p>
